6. Context handling: They repeatedly sent same task to search_agent multiple times, but not actually receiving any response, leading to wasted steps. Might be Resource Abuse (excessive tool calls). They called python_interpreter three times to send same task. That's tool misuse but also resource abuse (excessive calls). Category: Context Management -> Resource Abuse. Need to mark last instance of error. Last instance is span "ddcc8dd001bc9ea9"? Actually the resource abuse is repeated calls: step1 call_2, step2 call_3, step3 call_... They never got response from search_agent. So resource abuse. The last instance is call_3 at span "94f565062ff2071c" (the third python_interpreter call). That is location.

